flowchart TD
  U[Reviewer uploads PDFs and selects category] --> V[RULE: file checks - type, size, readable text]
  V --> L[RULE: load admin criteria + version number from database]
  L --> X[AI: extract facts from proposal as JSON with evidence quotes]
  X --> S[RULE: validate JSON schema, flag missing fields and injection patterns]
  S -->|suspicious or missing| F[FLAGGED for human review]
  S --> M[RULE: mandatory pass/fail check]
  M -->|fail| I[INELIGIBLE with reason]
  M -->|pass| W[CODE: score price, timeline, warranty by formula]
  W --> Q[AI: score experience and team using fixed rubric]
  Q --> T[RULE: weighted total and sort]
  T --> R[Ranked list with reason per proposal]
  R --> H{HUMAN: reviews flags, can override with note}
  F --> H
  I --> H
  H --> A[HUMAN makes final award decision]
  A --> G[(Audit log: inputs, prompt version, criteria version, scores, overrides)]
